# Mirrors CrossTabTables/.gitignore
.Rproj.user/
*.Rhistory
*.RData
Thumbs.db
*.html
*_files/

# Word lock files
~$*.docx

# Unzipped .docx left behind by render verification
.verify2/
.verifytmp/

# The rendered report IS tracked so drafts can be circulated through git.
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.docx everywhere, so this negation is what
# actually re-includes it; the root rule is left alone for every other project.
!PreferredSpeciesReport.docx

# Chapter 5 LPA (D152). Full MxModels embed respondent-level scale scores, so
# they stay local; Ch5LPA_results.rds (slim: diagnostics, posteriors,
# estimates) IS tracked and is all the report reads. Ch5LPA_fits.rds is the
# empty cache from the failed first run (F67) and can be deleted.
Ch5LPA_fits/
Ch5LPA_fits.rds
Ch5LPA_job.out

# Generated artifact from the abandoned Appendix A pour (D36). No longer
# produced by the report; the copy left on disk can be deleted.
SurveyInstrument_2025.docx
